{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "ac9c552339e7ad67662f35d87381f6bff5a0750c1e4ab333f1f606cc56111746", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nグッドタイミングなの♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n你来得正好唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "45cd84e692ab714874df39e76fa2b71adf28b0995f7a33029e00e1e6de96e7fa", "ja": "ねえねえ、今のミキを見て、ドキドキする？", "zh": "欸，你现在看着美希，会小鹿乱撞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8778d9536feac55526f1ea71822bab29c8311b68cc41d540b32f965b32cde687", "ja": "突然だな……。衣装がよく似合ってるとは思うけど、\nドキドキはしないかな？", "zh": "还真突然……我是觉得服装很适合你，\n但应该没有小鹿乱撞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "6fc74da00b8b2b0bebea7c07d3195a2999bacfc5f2aeb43f41a30d006c54f57a", "ja": "むー、思った通りなの。ミキ的には、この衣装すっごく\n気にいったから、みんなにドキドキしてほしいのに。", "zh": "唔──如美希所料唷，可是美希非常喜欢这套服装，\n很希望能让大家觉得小鹿乱撞的说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6b27ae89828f631000c1194c10746b7aef790a2e0d5f2837e9f9b1d137b23020", "ja": "さすがに、着て立ってるだけだと難しいよ。\n何かするとか、ポーズを決めるとかすれば……", "zh": "但光只是换好衣服站在原地，是很难的吧。\n至少再做点什么，或是摆出什么姿势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "0dbf265ca531f0d7c316d3b1e68ff6e2893f058c11718044622fcdc214d9c371", "ja": "そっか～。じゃあミキ、今から練習してみるね。\nミキのコト、いっぱい見てて☆", "zh": "这样啊～那美希现在就练习看看。\n你要一直看着美希喔☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2d16d3197667d30b6da4224c2404b5271628024e8e928f93afec34db0643ad93", "ja": "……ん？　あ、もう始まってるのか。\nちなみにそれは……何してるんだ？", "zh": "……嗯？啊，你已经开始了吗？\n顺便问一下，这是……在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "078d522f21cb8ebcf0881eceda4b7bb09c29ec7d6fded5a70ea05f29bf3bd7d0", "ja": "眠そうに、してみてるの……あふぅ。\nドキドキ……する……？", "zh": "美希在试着让自己显得很困……啊呼。\n你有……小鹿乱撞吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1009_p", "source_sha256": "468b450e80dd3e3489e9b9ebfde107e785fda9c7325b3b324176eec74c7e7f85", "ja": "本当に寝そうでハラハラするけど……。\nドキドキはしないかな。", "zh": "我怕你真的睡着而提心吊胆……\n但倒是不会小鹿乱撞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "65a2ade1c209807d04f2b0f8c7b8a3414b24d1d1b9439d639abf449564a94716", "ja": "そう？　じゃあ、次はこれ！", "zh": "是吗？那接下来换这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "a6410db75230577d130a78e6142bee1ae686d7516cbefc88e9b3a85e0c3badd7", "ja": "ぐすっ……ミキのコト、おいていかないで……。\nハニーに捨てられたら、ミキ、ミキ……！", "zh": "呜呜……不要丢下美希……\n要是被HONEY抛弃，美希、美希就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1012_p", "source_sha256": "928f23e9266a957355a1d906ceeabb681990533434a4baa8727359ba4b5ea08a", "ja": "ストップ！　そういうのは……ドキドキするけど、\n一刻も早くやめてほしいだけだぞ？", "zh": "停！这种情况……虽然我是会心跳加速，\n但纯粹只想拜托你赶快停下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "21c29375aa5cc0ea27762bb17b1141fed02bb3d5b13694ec2e16effb7636fcc4", "ja": "むー。ワガママはよくないって思うなっ。", "zh": "哼──美希觉得耍任性是不好的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1014_p", "source_sha256": "42016149bb7852c91a4bb4fc67bb34416e6aaf7da758e08807293c906c283b2e", "ja": "わがままじゃないが……。とにかく、美希の求めてる\nドキドキとは違う方向に行ってると思う。", "zh": "这不是耍任性……总之，我觉得美希你的做法\n跟你所追求的小鹿乱撞不在同一个方向上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1015_p", "source_sha256": "60f398fd5d3a3b3c173e047348dab331301e7a0e221f13d7f7e1aedcc366d310", "ja": "シチュエーション抜きでやってみたらどうだ？\nポーズだけ、仕草だけでドキドキさせてみてくれ。", "zh": "不然你试着不要加入情境剧怎么样？\n挑战看看只靠姿势或动作来让我小鹿乱撞吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "2f857fd69a7e87331838799aea63b630b610079bb426c89a5516569ef668d00d", "ja": "ポーズだけでドキドキさせるの？\nんー、じゃあ～。", "zh": "要只靠姿势就让你小鹿乱撞吗？\n嗯──那么～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "a3920d261ce425a7af08ba7ec55d6ef117d55ac09b238cfa9e54a07465bf205c", "ja": "……こんな、カンジ？", "zh": "……像这种感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1018_p", "source_sha256": "afc8636cad5789c6c651991f7a53c25eac602fdf484e6b6b38c141c17f6a95f5", "ja": "おっ……そうそう、そんな感じ。\nそれならみんな、ドキドキしてくれると思うぞ！", "zh": "哦……没错没错，就是这种感觉。\n大家看到应该都会觉得小鹿乱撞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "8d5ade4124c2fd6f9d0d49216efccc514d833a194993c886aec63cf125e74225", "ja": "ホント！？　じゃあ、これは大事な時に\nとっておくね☆　使う時が楽しみなの～♪", "zh": "真的吗！？那美希会等到重要时刻再摆出这个姿势☆\n真期待那个时刻到来唷～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ae7d31a193c4d7b6b1e389e4a8a5193ec822f925a8623a524f00d32e00ba60d2", "ja": "大事な時……？　\n次のライブで披露するんじゃないのか？", "zh": "重要时刻……？\n不是要在下次的演唱会摆出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
