{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0094_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "328f5bd3ae3a817809674196017f041573b0c66a5d2a7cb354010ccf4eb6477c", "ja": "いっぱい練習しとくから、楽しみにしてて？\nあはっ☆", "zh": "美希会努力多多练习，敬请好好期待吧。\n啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
